{"title":"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Compute the sum of all twenty-one terms of the geometric series\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/1/cc1b6f284c8465d2e1aa0af729878c3a9ab4fdbf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 + 2 + 4 + 8 + \\ldots + 1048576\\]\" width=\"229\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/d/45d9d26d1667d39deeed57a6d63b8ff6928178d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\,2097149\\quad\\mathrm{(B)}\\,2097151\\quad\\mathrm{(C)}\\,2097153\\quad\\mathrm{(D)}\\,2097157\\quad\\mathrm{(E)}\\,2097161$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"535\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Those are powers of 2. So it would make sense to multiply the series by 2:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/1/0a126c705856fb1d62ea4a4ee2fe2cd01215290b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1 + 2 + 4 + 8 + \\ldots + 1048576$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"266\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/4/9445f7229d2a450c963c01d41f279b0a13be4d01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x=2 + 4 + 8 + \\ldots + 1048576 + 2097152$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"329\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/0/dd0c910790ee6d463afd14617fceb532d1008378.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2097152-1=2097151 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm {(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"271\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 iTest Answer Key\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b>